From 74ef8c6106a820854dd3265011c34f4a10b7085f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 17:10:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] MENU15-CRISP (web): the Tools / Config / Debug menus drawn at
 their final size instead of 'old value x 1.5' -- sharp text and icons
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

EastSun 1001 (Tools menu screenshot): "你這邊不要直接用放大的 解析度太低太醜". Cause: the menu icons were 14px SVGs stretched by CSS to
21px (a 24-grid drawn at 0.875px per unit, 2.2 strokes -> 1.925px: every line on half pixels, grey fringes), and every size
was calc(old * --smz 1.5) (16.5px text, 7.5px padding, 43.5px rows, a 3px bevel). Now: --smz gone; text 17px / line-height
24px, padding 8/9px, gap 4px, 2px bevel; icons 24x24 SVG with viewBox 24 (1 unit = 1px), stroke 2, coordinates on whole
units (31 of 45 icons nudged; Bar Code bars as filled rects). Same outer size (Tools 581x441.5 -> 580x442, columns 186px,
rows 44px), same items / order / columns / grey and strike rules; no id / title / data-* touched.
Headless Edge 1920x1032: edge-blur ratio of the Tools icons 1.18 -> 0.33 at 100 %, 1.02 -> 0.88 at the 110 % UI zoom
(background.html #desktop zoom, outside this change).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
